<image:loc>https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6203cccbd3a65a1b05448121/23fe1422-b89a-4d16-b299-0e248110e9fa/Strouds+2nd+Floor.jpg</image:loc>
<image:title>Dining - Make it stand out</image:title>
<image:caption>Stroud’s at Daytona Lagoon Enjoy wings, pizza, burgers, and delicious smoked BBQ. The restaurant and bar feature beer & cocktails, games, sports and more!</image:caption>
</image:image>
<image:image>
<image:loc>https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6203cccbd3a65a1b05448121/e0becaa8-0cea-422d-b67e-4ab8461e5c58/IMG_1419+%281%29.jpg</image:loc>
<image:title>Dining - Make it stand out</image:title>
<image:caption>Sunny’s Scoops Nothing goes hand in hand better with fun than ice cream! Just steps away from the MEGA arcade is Sunny’s Scoops, home of the MEGA ice cream cone!</image:caption>
</image:image>
<image:image>
<image:loc>https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6203cccbd3a65a1b05448121/8f1f0eb2-9b17-40be-abb5-127826fea326/DSC_2122-2.jpg</image:loc>
<image:title>Dining - Wave Grill</image:title>
<image:caption>This waterpark meal post prepares delicious combos of sandwiches, dressed burgers, chicken tenders, quesadillas, giant pizza slices, and an array of beverages, draft beer, and dessert treats.</image:caption>
</image:image>
<image:image>
<image:loc>https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6203cccbd3a65a1b05448121/c4f7397f-9a0e-4261-bdd8-d68d538ec6e7/Daytona_Lagoon_2019_Morgan_Purvis_056.jpg</image:loc>
<image:title>Dining - Paradise Grill</image:title>
<image:caption>Located inside the Mega Arcade with indoor seating and air conditioning, you can cool off and enjoy great combo meals, pizza, and desserts. Sodas, coffees, frozen drinks, and cold beer are also available.</image:caption>
</image:image>
<image:image>
<image:loc>https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6203cccbd3a65a1b05448121/7a68e150-44bb-46d6-a11d-b9b7b828d977/DSC_2265-2.jpg</image:loc>
<image:title>Dining - Sunny’s Shack</image:title>
<image:caption>This waterpark outpost near the Castaway family area provides ICEE drinks, ice cream novelties, cold drinks, and snacks to keep the little ones cool and refreshed. Mini Melts are available inside and outside the water park. A variety of classic family frozen treat flavors are available.</image:caption>
